This folder holds the wheel's background music. Files here are NOT tracked in git (only this
marker is) and the deploy step leaves them untouched, so nothing here is ever overwritten or wiped.

To add a track: copy a file named theme<anything>.mp3 (also .ogg/.m4a works) into
/opt/gg/public/msc/ on the server, e.g.:
  scp theme7.mp3 <server>:/opt/gg/public/msc/
It joins the rotation within a minute — no commit, no deploy needed.

To remove a track: delete its file from that folder.

Other file names (e.g. chowd.mp3, carnage.mp3) are one-off sound effects played by explicit name
from public/js/pgwheel.js and are not part of the theme* rotation.
